  "solution": {
    "text": "We have,<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math></p><p>Then,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />And,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mi></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>As,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>det</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>det</mo><mfenced><mi>P</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>det</mo><mfenced><mi>P</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>det</mo><mfenced><mi>P</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Modulus of the sum of all possible values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>det</mi><mfenced><mi>P</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p>",
